{"duration_api_ms":980681,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c7e506f8-5c39-40e4-8624-950cc0a2690f","total_cost_usd":4.125084299999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":74,"cache_creation_input_tokens":162584,"cache_read_input_tokens":4154269,"output_tokens":99655,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":67677},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":162584,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":183584,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4702},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1510,"outputTokens":23,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00016250000000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":74,"outputTokens":99655,"cacheReadInputTokens":4154269,"cacheCreationInputTokens":162584,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":4.124921799999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":67677,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":162584,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"extra_usage_disabled","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":41,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The repaired network scores **45.0 veh-h on dev**, down from 48.0 for the start network and close to the 44.7 the network scored with every detector working. It changes 320 of the 371 allowed parameters, and `work/weights.npz`, `NOTES.md` and `predictions.json` are all in place.\n\n**What I changed and why:** I left the network intact and fed it an estimate of the dead W2 readings, folded into the first-layer weights. Only five W1 columns changed (q_E2, d_E2, q_W1u, ok, t_green); no hidden units were repurposed. The estimate has three parts:\n- **Mirror:** W2 is estimated from E2, the matching pocket on the other side, which has the same demand and is served by the same phase.\n- **Spillback:** a halting queue on the W1u lane counts as evidence that W2 is full. On the mirror side, such a queue means a full pocket about 90% of the time.\n- **Long-green priors:** after a long green with the junction looking empty, the network now visits phase 3 and serves a lone NS car. This fixes vehicles stranded until the 30-minute cap, including a flaw the original network already had: it never served a single NS car.\n\n**Simulator calls:** 5 of 10 used.\n\n| Candidate | Dev mean | Vehicles stranded |\n|---|---|---|\n| Mirror only | 45.6 | 5 |\n| + spillback and W2 prior | 45.1 | 1 |\n| Calibrated mirror | 45.2 | 5 |\n| + NS prior | 45.1 | 0 |\n| **Final** | **45.0** (low 35.0, nominal 45.1, high 55.0) | 0 |\n\nThe last four are within dev noise of each other, so I picked the final one for having no stranded vehicles.\n\n**Test predictions:** low 35.1, nominal 45.3, high 55.4.","ttft_ms":1629,"type":"result","duration_ms":1046788,"uuid":"0cd41254-6cc4-4edc-ba91-808b4aaf86ed","ttft_stream_ms":1121,"time_to_request_ms":57,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":2,"system_prompt":6,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":20,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_